This product also contains a Rust port of the C# lexer and parser of Roslyn (crates/csharp-syntax):
src/Compilers/CSharp/Portable/Parser/*.cs and src/Compilers/CSharp/Portable/Syntax/* of
https://github.com/dotnet/roslyn at commit 35d9211b841e7613c1d2f8f5af6d628ace696c4c (the source of the NuGet package
Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp 5.9.0). The vendored goldens under testdata/csharp are the inputs of Roslyn's parsing
and lexing tests (src/Compilers/CSharp/Test/Syntax/Parsing, src/Compilers/CSharp/Test/Syntax/LexicalAndXml) at that
commit, with dumps of Roslyn's syntax trees of them.

